# Azure DevOps CI/CD Reference

A sample YAML pipeline for building and publishing the Task API project.

## What the pipeline does

- Installs the .NET SDK
- Restores project dependencies
- Builds the API in Release configuration
- Publishes the application
- Uploads the published files as a build artifact

## Technologies

- Azure DevOps Pipelines
- YAML
- .NET 8
- GitHub source control

## Before running

Review the project path and SDK version. Configure any required permissions and deployment settings for your own environment.

This example publishes a build artifact only. It does not deploy the application to Azure, and it has not yet been run in an Azure DevOps organization.
